{%- liquid
  assign color_scheme_id = section.settings.color_scheme.id | default: section.settings.color_scheme | default: 'scheme-1'
  assign logo_alt = settings.logo.alt | default: shop.name

  # 5A-003, H-03. secondary_menu trae main-menu por defecto, como pide la Theme Store para
  # todo link_list de la cabecera. Si el comerciante no elige otro, seria el mismo menu que
  # el principal: en ese caso, o sin enlaces, no se pinta dos veces.
  assign show_secondary_menu = false
  if section.settings.secondary_menu.links.size > 0 and section.settings.secondary_menu.handle != section.settings.menu.handle
    assign show_secondary_menu = true
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Cabecera sticky (4F-001). Lo que se pega es la seccion que envuelve a la cabecera, no
  la <header>: una <header> sticky solo se pegaria dentro de su propia seccion, que mide
  exactamente lo mismo que ella, y no se moveria nunca.

  Su z-index resuelve ademas el defecto de la auditoria: el menu movil y el buscador viven
  dentro de la cabecera, y su z-index propio no sale del contexto de apilamiento que crea
  la cabecera. Con 150 ese contexto queda por encima de la barra de anuncio (21), de la
  barra de compra fija (40) y de los popovers del lookbook (120), y por debajo de los
  modales globales: cajon del carrito (200), guia de tallas (220), recogida en tienda
  (230) y contrasena (240).

  Solo con JavaScript: sin JS el menu de escritorio se despliega entero dentro de la
  cabecera, y pegar ese bloque alto a la ventana se comeria la pantalla.

  La regla vive en assets/base.css (.js .section-header, la clase que el schema da a la
  seccion). Antes era un bloque style de Liquid dentro del div de la seccion, y un
  elemento style en el body no es HTML valido (FIXES-PRE-SUBMISSION-001).
{%- endcomment -%}

<header class="site-header color-{{ color_scheme_id }}" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="container site-header__inner">
    <theme-drawer class="site-header__mobile-menu">
      <button
        class="icon-button site-header__menu-button"
        type="button"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="MobileMenu-{{ section.id }}"
        data-drawer-trigger
      >
        {% render 'icon', name: 'menu' %}
        <span>{{ 'general.navigation.menu' | t }}</span>
      </button>

      <div class="drawer-overlay" data-drawer-overlay hidden>
        <div
          id="MobileMenu-{{ section.id }}"
          class="drawer-panel color-{{ color_scheme_id }}"
          role="dialog"
          aria-modal="true"
          aria-label="{{ 'general.navigation.menu' | t }}"
          aria-hidden="true"
          tabindex="-1"
          data-drawer-panel
          inert
        >
          <div class="drawer-panel__header">
            <span class="h3">{{ 'general.navigation.menu' | t }}</span>
            <button class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="{{ 'general.accessibility.close' | t }}" data-drawer-close>
              {% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}
            </button>
          </div>

           <nav aria-label="{{ 'general.navigation.primary' | t }}">
            <ul class="mobile-nav unstyled-list" role="list">
              {%- for link in section.settings.menu.links -%}
                <li>
                  {%- if link.links != blank -%}
                    <theme-disclosure class="mobile-nav__disclosure">
                      <button
                        class="mobile-nav__toggle"
                        type="button"
                        aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="MobileMenu-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}"
                        data-disclosure-trigger
                      >
                        <span>{{ link.title | escape }}</span>
                        {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down', size: 16 %}
                      </button>
                      <div id="MobileMenu-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}" data-disclosure-panel hidden>
                        <ul class="mobile-nav__submenu unstyled-list" role="list">
                          <li>
                            <a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ 'general.navigation.view_all' | t: title: link.title }}</a>
                          </li>
                          {%- for child_link in link.links -%}
                            <li>
                              <a href="{{ child_link.url }}">{{ child_link.title | escape }}</a>
                              {%- if child_link.links != blank -%}
                                <ul class="mobile-nav__grandchildren unstyled-list" role="list">
                                  {%- for grandchild_link in child_link.links -%}
                                    <li><a href="{{ grandchild_link.url }}">{{ grandchild_link.title | escape }}</a></li>
                                  {%- endfor -%}
                                </ul>
                              {%- endif -%}
                            </li>
                          {%- endfor -%}
                        </ul>
                      </div>
                    </theme-disclosure>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <a class="mobile-nav__link" href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title | escape }}</a>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
             </ul>
           </nav>

          {%- if show_secondary_menu -%}
            <div class="drawer-panel__secondary">
              <nav aria-label="{{ 'general.navigation.secondary' | t }}">
                <ul class="drawer-panel__secondary-list unstyled-list" role="list">
                  {%- for link in section.settings.secondary_menu.links -%}
                    <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title | escape }}</a></li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              </nav>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="mobile-nav__localization">
            {% render 'localization-selectors', context: 'header-mobile' %}
          </div>
         </div>
      </div>
    </theme-drawer>

    <nav class="site-header__desktop-nav" aria-label="{{ 'general.navigation.primary' | t }}">
      <ul class="desktop-nav unstyled-list" role="list">
        {%- for link in section.settings.menu.links -%}
          <li>
            {%- if link.links != blank -%}
              {%- comment -%} 5C-001: panel clasico o mega menu, en el snippet. {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- render 'mega-menu', link: link, section: section, index: forloop.index, color_scheme_id: color_scheme_id -%}
            {%- else -%}
              <a class="desktop-nav__link" href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title | escape }}</a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </nav>

    {%- comment -%}
      5A-003, H-02. El ancho del logo llega como variable CSS: el atributo width del <img>
      lo anulaba la regla de base.css y el ajuste del editor no cambiaba nada. La proporcion
      sirve para acotar el alto en la cabecera movil sin deformar el archivo.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <a
      class="site-header__brand"
      href="{{ routes.root_url }}"
      aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }}"
      {% if settings.logo != blank %}style="--logo-width: {{ settings.logo_width }}px; --logo-ratio: {{ settings.logo.aspect_ratio | default: 1 }};"{% endif %}
    >
      {%- if settings.logo != blank -%}
        {{-
          settings.logo
          | image_url: width: 480
          | image_tag:
            class: 'site-header__logo-image',
            widths: '80, 120, 160, 200, 240, 320, 400, 480',
            width: settings.logo_width,
            alt: logo_alt
        -}}
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="site-header__brand-text">{{ shop.name | escape }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

     <div class="site-header__actions">
      {%- comment -%}
        Los mismos enlaces aparecen al pie del menu lateral en movil, donde hay sitio. Aqui
        se muestran solo desde 62rem, que es donde empieza la navegacion de escritorio.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if show_secondary_menu -%}
        <nav class="site-header__secondary" aria-label="{{ 'general.navigation.secondary' | t }}">
          <ul class="site-header__secondary-list unstyled-list" role="list">
            {%- for link in section.settings.secondary_menu.links -%}
              <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title | escape }}</a></li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>
      {%- endif -%}

      {% render 'predictive-search', section: section %}

      {% render 'localization-selectors', context: 'header' %}

      {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
        <shopify-account class="site-header__account" menu="{{ section.settings.customer_account_menu }}"></shopify-account>
      {%- endif -%}

      <a
        class="icon-button site-header__cart"
        href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
        {% if settings.show_cart_count %}data-cart-count-enabled{% endif %}
        aria-label="{% if settings.show_cart_count %}{{ 'sections.header.cart_count' | t: count: cart.item_count }}{% else %}{{ 'sections.header.cart' | t }}{% endif %}"
      >
        {% render 'icon', name: 'bag' %}
        {%- if settings.show_cart_count -%}
          <span class="site-header__cart-count" aria-hidden="true"{% if cart.item_count == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.header.name",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "section-header",
  "limit": 1,
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "menu",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.menu.label",
      "default": "main-menu"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.color_scheme.label",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "secondary_menu",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.secondary_menu.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.secondary_menu.info",
      "default": "main-menu"
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "customer_account_menu",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.customer_account_menu.label",
      "default": "customer-account-main-menu"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "mega_menu_promo",
      "name": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.name",
      "limit": 6,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "menu_item",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.menu_item.label",
          "info": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.menu_item.info"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.card_1.content"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image_1",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.image_1.label",
          "info": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.image_1.info"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading_1",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.heading_1.label"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "subheading_1",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.subheading_1.label"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link_1",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.link_1.label"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.card_2.content"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image_2",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.image_2.label",
          "info": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.image_2.info"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading_2",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.heading_2.label"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "subheading_2",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.subheading_2.label"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link_2",
          "label": "t:sections.header.blocks.mega_menu_promo.settings.link_2.label"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
